   "description": "After [[param:intertrial_interval]] of empty apertures, a warning dot appears between them for [[param:warning_duration]]; then a pair of perspective line drawings of ten-cube objects appears, one in each aperture. The subject presses [[param:same_key]] if the two are the same object or [[param:different_key]] if they are mirror images, as fast as possible while keeping errors low; the key stops the reaction-time clock and removes the pair. The two drawings differ by a picture-plane or a depth rotation of 0 to 180° in [[param:design.angle_step_deg]] steps.",
