   "notes": [
    "Paper values: 9° centre-to-centre spacing, drawings 4–5 cm at about 60 cm, warning then pair 0.5 s later, 10 objects × 18 views with 7 used, 0–180° in 20° steps, 200-trial blocks.",
    "Deviation: a visual warning dot replaces the warning tone; keys J (right hand, same) and F (left hand, different) replace levers; drawings are regenerated, the original objects cannot be reproduced.",
    "ASSUMED (not in the paper): 6 dva apertures, 0.3 dva dot, the 1.5 s inter-trial interval, the 30 s deadline, 4.3 dva mean extent, camera elevation and distance.",
